  "review": "Complete staged code, summaries and supplements read. Dependencies ApiCookbook and Checks and extracted Fragments inspected fully. Java standard library only. Original archived bodies and all negative examples retained; changed bodies correct long complement range check, typed mapping callback, Integer.compare, empty result guard and explicit EOF. No independent JVM run; author bounded recorded runs are supporting evidence only. ApiCookbook uses first-index preservation; quick reference uses latest prior index, both valid under any-pair contract. Unicode reversal is codepoint, not grapheme. No production or exhaustive concurrency proof."
